###
# AdonisJS Task API - Example Requests
# You can use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these
# OR use curl commands in terminal
###

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api/simple
@taskId = 1

### Home Page
GET http://localhost:3333

###
# SIMPLE API ENDPOINTS (No Authentication Required)
###

### 1. Get all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get task statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Create a new task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn AdonisJS basics",
  "description": "Complete the official tutorial and build a sample app"
}

### 4. Create another task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build a REST API",
  "description": "Create CRUD endpoints for task management"
}

### 5. Create task without description
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read AdonisJS documentation"
}

### 6. Get a specific task (change taskId if needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Update a task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn AdonisJS - Updated",
  "description": "Completed the basics, now learning advanced topics",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 8. Toggle task completion
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/toggle
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Delete a task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
# CURL EXAMPLES (Run in terminal)
###

# Create a task
# curl -X POST http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"title": "Learn AdonisJS", "description": "Complete tutorial"}'

# Get all tasks
# curl http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks

# Get stats
# curl http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks/stats

# Update task
# curl -X PUT http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks/1 \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d '{"title": "Updated", "isCompleted": true}'

# Toggle completion
# curl -X PATCH http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks/1/toggle

# Delete task
# curl -X DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/simple/tasks/1

